  m_text: 'Andar Bahar is a simple card game originating from Southern India. There
    are 2 sides to bet on, known as "Andar" and "Bahar". The first drawn card is
    placed in the middle, with the remainder being dealt with each side one at a
    time. The first side to match the middle card wins.

'
